#: src/Admin/UiSamplePage.php:52
msgid "Declarative render components: stateless PHP parts that echo markup carrying data-* contracts, which assets/js/admin.js binds its behaviors to. Input is each part's arguments array, output is the markup; every component appears once below."
msgstr "声明式渲染组件：无状态 PHP 零件，输出携带 data-* 契约的标记，行为层按属性挂接。入参为各零件的参数数组，出参为标记，每个组件仅演示一次"

