#: src/Admin/UiSamplePage.php:71
#: src/Admin/UiSamplePage.php:206
msgid "Search users…"
msgstr "搜索用户…"

#: src/Admin/UiSamplePage.php:79
msgid "Notice banners"
msgstr "通知横幅"

#: src/Admin/UiSamplePage.php:80
msgid "notice clamps the variant to the four core notice states and renders one banner through wp_kses_post, with optional is-dismissible and the inline form for table rows. flash rides it for the round trip: the note key this page's own redirect set picks the message and adds is-dismissible, unknown notes render nothing."
msgstr "notice 把变体夹逼到 WP 核心的四种通知状态，经 wp_kses_post 渲染一条横幅，可选 is-dismissible 与表格行用的 inline 形态；flash 在其上承接往返回执：本页跳转写入的 note 键选出消息并追加 is-dismissible，未知 note 不渲染"

#: src/Admin/UiSamplePage.php:81
msgid "A plain informational banner."
msgstr "普通信息横幅"

#: src/Admin/UiSamplePage.php:82
msgid "A dismissible warning banner."
msgstr "可关闭的警告横幅"

#: src/Admin/UiSamplePage.php:84
msgid "Section heading"
msgstr "分区标题"

#: src/Admin/UiSamplePage.php:85
msgid "heading echoes h1, h2 or h3 with the class aiya-core-heading; the level clamps to 1-3 and the spacing lives in the kit stylesheet. Every section title on this page renders through it."
msgstr "heading 输出携带 aiya-core-heading 类的 h1、h2 或 h3，级别夹逼在 1 到 3，间距由 kit 样式表承载；本页每个章节标题都经它渲染"

#: src/Admin/UiSamplePage.php:87
msgid "List table & pagination"
msgstr "列表件与分页"

#: src/Admin/UiSamplePage.php:88
msgid "listTable takes a columns spec, a rows iterable and a cell callable, and renders the shared table baseline with a uniform empty state. listNav is a kit-owned one-line bar whose parts are the plain kit controls: arrow links with the shared button classes, a jump input on the top bar, a static readout on the bottom bar, opt-in jump and per-page switches. filterBar is the GET form shell composed into the top bar."
msgstr "listTable 接收列定义、行迭代器与单元格回调，渲染统一基线的表格与空态。listNav 是 kit 自有的一段式导航条，零件即裸 kit 控件：携带共享按钮类的箭头链接、顶栏跳页输入框、底栏静态读数，可选的跳页与每页行数开关。filterBar 是合成进顶栏的 GET 表单壳"

