#: src/Domain/Payment/PaymentModule.php:174
msgid "Activates memberships from Afdian: webhook pushes and the order-number self-service check. Each order settles by the plan it was paid under, into the matching row of the plan table below — pushes are settled by re-querying the platform, never by trusting the push body."
msgstr "开启从爱发电激活会员：webhook 推送与订单号自助查询。每笔订单按它实际购买的方案，结算到下方方案表里对应的那一行 —— 推送一律以重新查单为准，不信任推送内容。"

#: src/Domain/Payment/PaymentModule.php:180
msgid "Afdian plan table"
msgstr "爱发电方案表"

#: src/Domain/Payment/PaymentModule.php:181
msgid "One row per Afdian plan you sell: the platform plan id, the key its orders are recorded under, and the entitlement that key grants. Plans are not priced here — the amount lives on the Afdian page and is only booked, never compared. A paid order for a plan that is not listed here is still booked (money is never swallowed) but grants nothing until you add the row and the order is re-submitted."
msgstr "一行一个在售的爱发电方案：平台方案 ID、订单与权益记录所用的键、以及该键授予的权益快照。这里不设价格 —— 金额在爱发电页面上，只落账、不比对。未列入此表的方案收到付款仍会落账（不会吞钱），但不会发权益，直到你补上这一行并重新提交订单。"

#: src/Domain/Payment/PaymentModule.php:188
msgid "Disabled plans leave the purchase list and refuse new deep links; orders already paid for still settle."
msgstr "关闭后不再出现在购买列表、也不再签发深链；已付款的订单照常结算。"

#: src/Domain/Payment/PaymentModule.php:194
msgid "Afdian plan id"
msgstr "爱发电方案 ID"

#: src/Domain/Payment/PaymentModule.php:195
msgid "The plan_id segment of the Afdian plan page URL. Orders carrying this id settle into this row."
msgstr "爱发电方案页 URL 里的 plan_id 段。携带该 ID 的订单结算到这一行。"

#: src/Domain/Payment/PaymentModule.php:203
msgid "Stable identifier the orders and the entitlement queue record this plan under — lowercase letters, digits, dashes or underscores, fixed once purchases reference it, and never the same as a cashier tier key."
msgstr "订单与权益队列记录该方案所用的稳定标识 —— 小写字母、数字、短横线或下划线，一旦有购买引用就不要再改，且不得与收银台档位的键相同。"

#: src/Domain/Payment/PaymentModule.php:219
msgid "One-liner shown on the plan card (what the plan includes)."
msgstr "方案卡上的一句话说明（这个方案包含什么）。"

#: src/Domain/Payment/PaymentModule.php:245
msgid "Max cycles per order"
msgstr "单单最多周期数"

#: src/Domain/Payment/PaymentModule.php:246
msgid "Ceiling on the months one purchase may queue — a garbage order row cannot buy years of membership."
msgstr "一笔购买最多能排入的周期数上限 —— 一条异常的订单行买不走多年的会员。"

