msgid "Message template"
msgstr "消息模板"

#: src/Domain/Telegram/TelegramModule.php:142
msgid "The push message body in Telegram HTML. Placeholders: {front} the front-end origin, {type} and {slug} the post's public type and slug, {id}, {title}, {excerpt}, {tags} and {categories} display names with a # prefix, {date}, {author}. Links are yours to compose from {front}, {type} and {slug}; the backend keeps no front-end route shapes. Every substitution is escaped, so the markup you write here is the only markup; leaving a placeholder out drops that part. Empty restores the default. Bounds: the title caps at 250 characters, the excerpt at 400 (hand-filled excerpt first, else the stripped content), and the whole message clamps to the platform limit of 4096 characters with the excerpt yielding first."
msgstr "推送消息正文，Telegram HTML 格式。占位符：{front} 前台源站，{type} 与 {slug} 为文章的公开类型与别名，{id}、{title}、{excerpt}、{tags} 与 {categories} 为加 # 前缀的显示名，{date}、{author}。链接由你自行用 {front}、{type}、{slug} 拼装，后端不记录前台路由形状。所有替换值均经转义，这里写的标记就是唯一标记；省略占位符即省略该部分。留空恢复默认。边界：标题上限 250 字符，摘要上限 400（先取手填摘要，否则取剥离标签后的正文），整条消息钳制到平台 4096 字符上限，超长时先压缩摘要。"

