#: src/Domain/Telegram/TelegramModule.php:220
msgid "The web thread is the source of truth for the support chat: this erases the visitors' messages, your replies and the Telegram bindings in one go, and old bot copies in your chat stop routing replies back. The mirror feed's table is a different one and stays."
msgstr "网页客服线程是事实源：此操作一并擦除访客留言、你的回复与 Telegram 绑定，私聊里旧 bot 副本的回复将不再回流。镜像 feed 的表在另一张，不受影响。"

