#: uninstall.php:98
msgid "Delete AIYA CMS"
msgstr "删除 AIYA CMS"

#: uninstall.php:100
msgid "WordPress is about to delete the plugin files. Before that happens, choose what to do with the data the plugin wrote."
msgstr "WordPress 即将删除插件文件。在此之前，请先确认插件写入的数据如何处理。"

#: uninstall.php:111
msgid "Keep the data"
msgstr "保留数据"

#: uninstall.php:113
msgid "Deletes only the plugin files. The plugin tables, aiya_core_* settings, meta fields and scheduled events survive, so reinstalling picks up where it left off — the safe answer for plugin updates."
msgstr "只删除插件文件。插件数据表、aiya_core_* 设置、元数据与定时任务全部保留，重装后自动接回原状态——插件更新场景的安全选择。"

#: uninstall.php:114
msgid "Delete plugin only, keep the data"
msgstr "仅删除插件，保留数据"

#: uninstall.php:118
msgid "Erase everything"
msgstr "全部清除"

#: uninstall.php:120
msgid "Also drops the plugin tables (favorites, follows, auth tokens, notifications, credits, memberships, redeem codes, payment orders, stats, discussions) plus the aiya_core_* options, meta residue, transients and scheduled events. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "同时删除插件数据表（收藏、关注、认证令牌、通知、积分、会员、兑换码、支付流水、运营统计、社区）以及 aiya_core_* 设置、元数据残留、瞬时数据与定时任务。此操作不可恢复。"

#: uninstall.php:121
msgid "Delete plugin and erase all data"
msgstr "删除插件并清除全部数据"

#: uninstall.php:128
msgid "Kept either way:"
msgstr "两种选择均保留："

#: uninstall.php:129
msgid "uploaded media and the wp-content/aiya_thumbnail/ tree (generated covers and avatars), and the pic-bed pool."
msgstr "上传的媒体文件与 wp-content/aiya_thumbnail/ 目录（生成的封面与头像），以及图床文件池。"

#: uninstall.php:131
msgid "Heavy dependency directories such as vendor/ are moved aside instantly so the deletion never blocks, and a daily cleanup cron removes the staged copy from wp-content/upgrade/ afterwards."
msgstr "vendor/ 等大型依赖目录会被瞬时移出、避免删除过程长时间阻塞，稍后由每日清理任务从 wp-content/upgrade/ 中移除暂存副本。"

#: uninstall.php:132
msgid "Cancel, back to the plugin list"
msgstr "取消，返回插件列表"

#: src/Domain/Blocks/BlocksModule.php:216
